<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-15T17:13:34.972Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:13:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Boko Haram and ISWAP militants are continuing to strike military posts in Borno, killing soldiers and destroying vehicles, while bandits and Islamist fighters killed a traditional ruler in Plateau and an immigration officer in Niger. The NIS has vowed justice after the officer was killed and another was injured in the Niger attack. Civilians have also been abducted in Niger, Kaduna and Zamfara, and a Christian Red Cross volunteer was killed in the northwest. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcVF3RUtRN2k0NG40WkFWUUQ1eFFuWEJZenZzM0lLWFRNNFNZWHZEdGg4MTZfQV9DZUtwSjQ1dE9LSzE2SjQ3V3F4RkdqQUpleHNtRGM1S216ZW9HYnJxSDJuUnJWRFF6SHliQWRqM0t0eTZaRVMwdzVsaG5RTzZuLVg1Q0l4a2FxN1FRUEVvUlJOeVFZS3JreGl1Z1hBZ1BxbjJCc3p6VnZSZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPbWZDUVV0ZE9JNWRhc1JzT2JQa3JpNWRKNDRLa0poRmpMaDlZZEZ3VmxyNjJtUVlMVVhkT0pXd191elBCbFNKdGx0b2pJVDBYM1lYWGoxTkRhMzVhX3lrNDdmSnY2bW1XaTZ6X1F2TGlXYW1qTHRYdWJ3b1dwMzdUOHV5X1dwbXM2TzFPMDI1d1RUUjFTOUI2aFA4SkV0eUFINVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Intel Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQbkN6ejU4cVJNRmQ2ZUVmTldXLUFQaXd3RnIyTFZXSHZDRWZreG5Ed1VpMzY3bXJtOS1USkxVcTB4NmdsY2lnVmx4bHFQM1lpUTJncmUxa0dsWjU1Qm9HZ0tRWWFpOW45MW9ISXF4SE9mOUtoWFc0b05DZWFjWjl0NjRmUFNVNmc1a05IZHZKOEdmRzVSWVdCaEZVbFlGeGJKbGpwS0l0eEpzMWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;